Z||000009||william_thorniii||01-18-2000||12:06 PM||||Friends,<P>Mr. Mike is currently performing R & D on cloth seat covers.  You might have followed my post a week ago about seat covers.  I e-mailed Mr. Mike at the beginning of that thread and within a thread he was asking me what I though about some color swatches.  He did not have an estimated arrival date or price yet though.  I am going to try to wait it out a year without them.  If I haven't seen anything pop up, then I will try some alternate solutions.<P>William T. Thorn, III||||reg||10
